{
  "$comment": "WebOS app map. 'workspace' lists the App UI routes opened as windows (/workspace/<route>). 'members' declares how each apps/* member runs in the desktop when its name does not already tell (Craft families are derived from the capability catalog of @aphrody/bun-workspace): kind web opens 'opens' directly; other kinds open the member window (README, downloads from the downloads service, source) with 'related' as the in-browser counterpart. Deep-link paths live in infra/config/routes.catalog.json.",
